Deaktop Keyborad for X Windows
Developed by Kulina Systems, Trivandrum Kerala India


One can clone the code from github and bui;id it, ie;

git clone git@github.com:tcbabu/isan.git
cd isan
make
sudo make install

Hopefully, the code includes everything and normally
there should not be any problem.

One also download the binary tarball/package install once
it is provided in 'SourceForge'.

